couple of moves here, thus} 64. Rf7 Rg4 65. a6 Kb8 66. b6 Rg3+ 67. Kb4 Rg4+ 68.
Kc5 Rg5+ 69. Kd4 Rg4+ 70. Ke5 Rg5+ 71. Ke6 Rg6+ 72. Rf6 Rg8 73. Kd6 Rd8+ 74.
